{"seq":19,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-06-l2-quarrendon-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T16:04:56.783Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-15T21:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d0643f917236de4c950ba1ca27a262cd63e0961acbb4581067e2c9abab10f137","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Hollis, I looked but couldn't find a link to a new travel policy in anything you have access to. I checked #general, #help-it-ops, #central-team, #central-random and the shared files, and the workspace knowledge base didn't turn anything up either. It might not have been posted to Slack or the share yet. Your best bet is probably to ask in #general or check with Ruth Calloway. If you'd like, I can post the question in #general for you."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792116000.000124"}}
